Am I Racist?

12
01:03:47,368 --> 01:03:53,368
is a 2024 American satirical documentary comedy film starring conservative political commentator
Matt Walsh that lampoons the diversity, equity, and inclusion (DEI) movement.

13
01:09:06,315 --> 01:09:12,315
Directed by Justin Folk for The Daily Wire, it follows Walsh as he poses as a "bumbling DEI
trainee", using subterfuge to interview experts and attend anti-racism workshops.

14
01:14:25,263 --> 01:14:31,263
The film has been described as a mockumentary in the style of Borat.

15
01:19:44,210 --> 01:19:50,210
With a production budget of $3 million, the film was theatrically
released in the United States on September 13, 2024.

16
01:25:03,157 --> 01:25:09,157
It grossed $12.3 million, becoming the
highest-grossing documentary film of 2024.

17
01:30:22,105 --> 01:30:28,105
The film explores themes of politics, racism,
disguise, obnoxious, self-loathing.

18
01:35:41,052 --> 01:35:47,052
The tone is lighthearted and thought_provoking.
